flowchart TD
  A["forward pass<br/>predict with current parameters"]
  B["loss<br/>turn error into a number"]
  C["backpropagation<br/>compute each parameter gradient"]
  D["optimizer<br/>apply learning rate and update rule"]
  E["new parameters<br/>starting point of next step"]

  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D --> E

  B -. "how wrong is it" .-> C
  C -. "which direction reduces it" .-> D
  D -. "how large should the move be" .-> E
